onucleotides, with a preference for dUMP (Ref.12). Also dephosphsphorylates dTMP, exhibits intermediate activity towards dGMP, and low activity towards dCMP and dAMP (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}